WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.025
The facts each re-read depends
on, read on November first.

2
00:00:04.025 --> 00:00:06.787
The Table API lists and patches records,

3
00:00:06.787 --> 00:00:12.312
and the Attachment API uploads the evidence
file with a mandatory content type.

4
00:00:12.312 --> 00:00:15.757
An account is re-read through
SailPoint's Accounts API,

5
00:00:15.757 --> 00:00:20.657
an identity through Search on the
identities index, and an Entra user through

6
00:00:20.657 --> 00:00:25.250
Graph's get-a-user call, which returns
not found when the user doesn't exist.

7
00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:28.490
And SailPoint's own best-practice
page confirms the gap:

8
00:00:28.490 --> 00:00:33.190
the mapped ServiceNow status decides
when it treats provisioning as complete.
